VALUES (NULL, NULL, 26951, 'Pillars of Eternity II: Deadfire', 'Pillars of Eternity II: Deadfire', 'game', 2018, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wuo.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/pwu3jgapxgj7enhcx1ii.jpg', 'Obsidian Entertainment proudly presents the sequel to our crowdfunded and critically-acclaimed role-playing game, Pillars of Eternity. Welcome to Pillars of Eternity II: Deadfire. With Pillars II, we are revisiting the rich narrative, beautiful environments, and tactical combat that made Pillars of Eternity one of the highest-rated PC games of all time.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/pillars-of-eternity-ii-deadfire', '["PlayStation 4", "Linux", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac", "Xbox One", "Nintendo Switch"]', NULL, 8.4, 0, 1.1700000000000001e+01, '2026-11-24 04:24:23', '2026-11-24 04:24:23')
