Walk upon the Ravenfield with your BLUE allies! Take down those pesky REDs using helicopters, cars, guns, and active ragdoll physics.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/ravenfield', '["Linux", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac"]', NULL, 7.0, 0, 8.03, '2026-11-24 04:24:23', '2026-11-24 04:24:23')
