VALUES (NULL, NULL, 2686, 'Star Fox Adventures', 'Star Fox Adventures', 'game', 2002, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pek.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar49fy.jpg', 'Star Fox Adventures takes place in a vast 3-D world full of strange scenery, brain-teasing puzzles and intense action. Learn the secrets of a mystical staff to fend off enemies and cast a variety of spells. Plus the intuitive, enemy-locking target system allows you to battle foes without skipping a beat. And you''ll need to build clever strategies to defeat the huge boss enemies.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/star-fox-adventures', '["Nintendo GameCube"]', NULL, 6.5, 0, 10.01, '2026-11-24 04:24:23', '2026-11-24 04:24:23')
