VALUES (NULL, NULL, 6958, 'Dante''s Inferno', 'Dante''s Inferno', 'game', 2010, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28oa.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar3m20.jpg', 'Dante''s Inferno is an epic single player, third-person action adventure game inspired by "Inferno", part one of Dante Alighieri''s classic Italian poem, "The Divine Comedy." Featuring nonstop action rendered at 60 frames-per-second, signature and upgradable weapons, attack combos and mana-fueled spells and the choice of punishing or absolving the souls of defeated enemies, it is a classic Medieval tale of the eternal conflict with sin and the resulting horrors of hell, adapted for a new generation and a new medium.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/dante-s-inferno', '["PlayStation 3", "PlayStation Portable", "Xbox 360"]', NULL, 7.5, 0, 1.1, '2026-11-24 04:24:23', '2026-11-24 04:24:23')
