Combining building-oriented gameplay with a healthy dose of Latin American political intrigue - Tropico bundles it all up in a fun, totally original and utterly addictive package.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/tropico', '["PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac"]', NULL, 8.2, 0, 1.04, '2026-11-24 04:24:23', '2026-11-24 04:24:23')
