VALUES (NULL, NULL, 921, 'Capitalism II', 'Capitalism II', 'game', 2001, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2l61.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/arlmt.jpg', 'Capitalism II is a business simulation where players build and manage a corporate empire. The game covers key aspects of commerce, including manufacturing, marketing, research, and stock trading. Players make strategic decisions, hire executives, develop technology, and expand into industries like media and real estate. With a realistic market system, it offers a detailed and immersive corporate experience.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/capitalism-ii', '["PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac"]', NULL, 4.3, 0, 1.01, '2026-11-24 04:24:23', '2026-11-24 04:24:23')
