VALUES (NULL, NULL, 19698, 'Albion Online', 'Albion Online', 'game', 2017, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/cocsxx.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar4q36.jpg', 'Albion Online is a free-to-play sandbox MMORPG set in a medieval fantasy world inspired by Arthurian legends. The game uses a classless system where a player''s equipped gear determines their abilities and playstyle. Items span eight tiers and are entirely player-crafted, forming a fully player-driven economy. The open world features zones with varying levels of PvP risk, from safe areas to full-loot zones where defeated players lose their equipment. Players can join guilds of up to 300 members to fight over territories and castles in large-scale battles. The game also offers PvE combat and various gathering and crafting activities.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/albion-online', '["Xbox Series X|S", "Linux", "Android", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "iOS", "Mac"]', NULL, 8.3, 0, 1.01, '2026-11-24 04:24:23', '2026-11-24 04:24:23')
