VALUES (NULL, NULL, 3772, 'Wreckfest', 'Wreckfest', 'game', 2018, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3vof.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar751.jpg', 'Wreckfest is a racing and vehicular combat game centered on demolition derbies and banger racing, with a focus on realistic physics and location-based vehicle damage that changes how cars handle as they take hits. Before an event, players pick a car, adjust assists such as transmission type and braking aids, and can buy, customise, and upgrade vehicles. Races reward a balance of defensive driving and aggressive tactics like ramming and shunting rivals into barriers. The game offers career, multiplayer, and custom event play, and is regarded as a spiritual successor to the FlatOut series.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/wreckfest', '["Google Stadia", "PlayStation 4", "Android", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "iOS", "PlayStation 5", "Xbox One", "Nintendo Switch"]', NULL, 7.5, 0, 1.08, '2026-11-24 04:24:23', '2026-11-24 04:24:23')
