VALUES (NULL, NULL, 4254, 'Mad Dog McCree', 'Mad Dog McCree', 'game', 1990, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9ebe.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar1kkr.jpg', 'Real motion picture action!

Mad Dog McCree is known worldwide as one of the highest rated arcade games and is the first interactive shooting game with real live motion picture action. Mad Dog and his men have kidnapped the town''s Mayor and his daughter. To save the town, you will be challenged by a saloon full of outlaws, a hair-raising bank robbery, gunfighters, a slew of old West ambushes, and Mad Dog himself. Mad Dog McCree is the first of a series of exciting Mad Dog adventures.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/mad-dog-mccree', '["Arcade", "DVD Player", "Philips CD-i", "PlayStation 3", "Nintendo 3DS", "Wii", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "iOS", "3DO Interactive Multiplayer", "Mac", "DOS", "Sega CD"]', NULL, 5.7, 0, 9.02, '2026-11-24 04:24:23', '2026-11-24 04:24:23')
