VALUES (NULL, NULL, 2368, 'Dark Souls II', 'Dark Souls II', 'game', 2014, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/cobysr.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/wokibreon8wydfbv84ez.jpg', 'Dark Souls II is an action role-playing game set in the kingdom of Drangleic. Players control the Bearer of the Curse, navigating a dark, interconnected world filled with challenging enemies and complex boss encounters. Combat emphasizes precise timing, stamina management, and adaptability, with options for dual-wielding, varied weapon types, and a flexible character progression system.

The online servers were shut down on March 31st, 2024.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/dark-souls-ii', '["PlayStation 3", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Xbox 360"]', NULL, 8.5, 0, 6.325, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-24 04:24:23')
